<title>USA: Viacom ups Spelling stake by 5 pct to 80 pct.</title>
<headline>Viacom ups Spelling stake by 5 pct to 80 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viacom Inc said on Friday it will buy an additional five percent stake in Spelling Entertainment Group Inc, bringing its ownership of the unit to 80 percent.</p>
<p>Viacom said the acquisition is intended to consolidate results for tax purposes and does not plan to buy any more of Spelling, which creates and distributes film and television, including the popular TV shows &quot;Beverly Hills 90210&quot; and &quot;Melrose Place&quot;.</p>
<p>Viacom said it expects to complete the stock purchases in the open market by the end of the 1997.</p>
</text>
